WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:02.820
Long live the Romanoffs!

00:02.820 --> 00:05.010
Long live Emperor Minchester!

00:05.010 --> 00:06.970
Long live Britia!

00:21.030 --> 00:24.750
Who is that beautiful lady with the marquis?

00:24.750 --> 00:27.240
It's Lady Elise, isn't it?

00:27.240 --> 00:29.530
Oh, is that her?

00:29.530 --> 00:31.400
Today, after the celebratory address,

00:31.400 --> 00:34.150
it seems His Majesty is going 
make that announcement.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.880
<i>I just want to go home so that I can study.</i>

02:27.880 --> 02:30.250
<i>The physician's exam is nearly here.</i>

02:30.710 --> 02:34.560
<i>But attending His Majesty's birthday 
celebration is a noble's duty.</i>

02:35.640 --> 02:38.760
<i>Now that I think about it, 
I wonder if </i>he's<i> here, too.</i>

02:42.290 --> 02:43.620
<i>Mikhail.</i>

02:44.430 --> 02:47.950
<i>In my first life, he was my only friend.</i>

03:09.550 --> 03:11.670
<i>Still, it's so strange.</i>

03:12.430 --> 03:15.610
<i>I was never on the same page as the 
person I wanted to feel closest to...</i>

03:16.530 --> 03:21.170
<i>and the person I needed to stay 
away from most was my best friend.</i>

03:24.640 --> 03:29.020
<i>Clashes with other countries aren't 
the only conflict in the empire.</i>

03:29.020 --> 03:30.200
<i>Within the empire, too...</i>

03:30.980 --> 03:33.550
<i>There's the imperial family's 
faction, led by my father.</i>

03:36.280 --> 03:39.820
<i>Then, there's the opposing nobles' faction, 
which supports the third prince,</i>

03:40.660 --> 03:43.140
<i>led by the House of Child.</i>

03:43.740 --> 03:46.670
It's been some time, hasn't 
it, Lady Clorence?

03:47.790 --> 03:49.530
Lady Child.

03:50.500 --> 03:55.080
To think that you'd remember 
my name. I'm truly honored.

03:55.290 --> 03:56.710
<i>That's right!</i>

03:58.410 --> 04:03.040
<i>Our families are from opposing factions, so 
it's natural that we fought like cats and dogs,</i>

04:03.040 --> 04:05.630
<i>but the biggest reason we clashed...</i>

04:06.700 --> 04:10.290
<i>was that she had passionate feelings 
for the crown prince, too.</i>

04:13.020 --> 04:16.920
<i>Thinking back on it now, there was 
no need for us to fight so much.</i>

04:16.920 --> 04:18.950
Why are you just standing there in a daze?

04:20.350 --> 04:25.150
Oh, um, I was remembering a 
few things from the past.

04:25.150 --> 04:26.940
Things from the past?

04:28.350 --> 04:32.370
Could it be the time when you 
secretly left a frog at my desk?

04:32.720 --> 04:37.150
Or could it be last year's feast, when 
you threw my shoes into the pond?

04:37.150 --> 04:38.130
Or...

04:41.850 --> 04:44.860
Oh, I'm so terribly sorry!

04:44.860 --> 04:47.960
I thought I saw a bug in front of me.

04:48.480 --> 04:51.600
<i>The old me was so...</i>

04:52.280 --> 04:57.660
I have been incredibly disrespectful 
toward you! I'm so very sorry!

04:57.660 --> 05:02.390
I know that apologizing now won't erase 
the displeasure you felt at the time,

05:02.390 --> 05:04.190
but still I beg your forgiveness!

05:04.920 --> 05:08.200
Where is this coming from? 
Are you making fun of me?

05:08.200 --> 05:13.290
Not at all. I've just realized how 
selfish my behavior has been.

05:15.650 --> 05:18.510
That's enough. Raise your head.

05:19.720 --> 05:23.290
You seem different than usual today.

05:24.610 --> 05:25.450
What?

05:27.010 --> 05:29.840
His Highness, the crown prince!

05:31.340 --> 05:35.220
The prince dislikes celebrations, 
and he's already here?

05:35.220 --> 05:37.650
I wonder what could have happened.

05:37.650 --> 05:39.990
Do you think it's because 
of the announcement?

05:48.560 --> 05:50.330
<i>Is he looking at me?</i>

05:51.010 --> 05:52.390
<i>No, of course not.</i>

05:52.390 --> 05:53.640
His Highness is...

05:53.640 --> 05:54.290
What?

05:56.510 --> 06:00.690
His Highness is looking at me.

06:06.690 --> 06:07.640
Lady Child?

06:07.640 --> 06:08.870
Lady Child!

06:10.470 --> 06:13.020
You have a terrible fever!

06:13.020 --> 06:14.460
I'm sorry.

06:14.460 --> 06:17.140
Lady Child, shouldn't you go and lie down?

06:18.650 --> 06:23.140
Attending the birthday celebrations 
is a noble's duty. Besides...

06:23.140 --> 06:27.660
I wouldn't trade my time near the 
prince for anything in the world.

06:28.850 --> 06:30.930
<i>Because of their political positions,</i>

06:30.930 --> 06:35.640
<i>there's a chasm between her and the prince 
deeper than that between Romeo and Juliet.</i>

06:36.350 --> 06:38.730
<i>Even so, she cares deeply 
for His Highness...</i>

06:40.500 --> 06:42.490
<i>She's earnest and honorable.</i>

06:42.490 --> 06:45.150
<i>Wouldn't someone who 
possesses those qualities</i>

06:45.150 --> 06:48.790
<i>be a worthy crown princess, 
and eventually, mother of this empire?</i>

06:50.600 --> 06:51.750
Elise.

06:53.210 --> 06:54.640
I've been looking for you.

06:55.090 --> 06:57.280
It's better not to interact 
with the House of Child.

06:58.100 --> 06:58.970
Let's go.

07:00.740 --> 07:02.060
Look at that.

07:02.060 --> 07:04.040
Very nice.

07:04.040 --> 07:04.720
Yes.

07:10.470 --> 07:13.070
<i>What are you staring at?</i>

07:16.280 --> 07:18.700
<i>All you need do is enjoy the celebrations.</i>

07:20.470 --> 07:21.420
Your Highness?

07:23.040 --> 07:25.830
Is there something which displeases you?

07:26.250 --> 07:28.530
No, it's nothing.

07:29.150 --> 07:32.820
Has someone done something to irk you?

07:33.260 --> 07:35.840
I will resolve the matter immediately.

07:36.250 --> 07:38.740
<i>Is being dense hereditary?</i>

07:38.740 --> 07:41.380
<i>This is all your younger 
sister's fault, you know.</i>

07:52.830 --> 07:54.990
<i>If she dances, her fever will...</i>

07:55.820 --> 07:59.650
<i>She's watching so intently. 
Is she interested in dancing?</i>

08:01.240 --> 08:02.750
Are you here alone?

08:03.250 --> 08:04.500
I, um...

08:04.750 --> 08:08.450
Beautiful lady, won't you 
share a dance with me?

08:11.910 --> 08:16.830
<i>Refusing without a particular reason
 would be disrespectful.</i>

08:16.830 --> 08:17.920
<i>But...</i>

08:18.720 --> 08:20.820
You truly are beautiful.

08:20.820 --> 08:21.800
Yes.

08:21.800 --> 08:23.480
Well, my lady?

08:32.600 --> 08:33.510
Wait.

08:40.490 --> 08:41.650
Your Highness!

08:43.070 --> 08:47.260
Lady Elise, will you dance with me?

08:47.260 --> 08:48.360
What?

08:55.910 --> 09:00.080
Your Highness, why did you 
invite me to dance with you?

09:01.110 --> 09:02.400
It's just a whim.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.270
I see.

09:04.970 --> 09:09.170
<i>Of course. His Highness would never 
actually want to dance with me.</i>

09:12.700 --> 09:14.750
Was it wrong of me to ask you?

09:15.130 --> 09:18.430
Not at all. I was at a loss, 
so it was a great help.

09:20.390 --> 09:23.730
If it was of help to you, 
then that's enough.

09:24.060 --> 09:30.130
His Highness is? But he hasn't danced 
in public at all lately.

09:30.130 --> 09:33.020
His Highness has always been 
renowned for his dancing,

09:33.020 --> 09:35.360
but that lady is quite good, too.

09:35.360 --> 09:37.310
She's young, but she's very impressive.

09:37.310 --> 09:40.100
And they're perfectly in 
step with each other.

09:40.100 --> 09:44.750
The prince's fiancée is supposed to 
be announced today. It must be...

09:44.750 --> 09:48.320
Yes, it must be Lady Elise.

09:51.170 --> 09:57.320
<i>In the past, I practiced feverishly in order 
to be able to follow his complicated lead.</i>

10:00.750 --> 10:02.820
<i>The day I first danced with His Highness,</i>

10:03.500 --> 10:07.570
<i>not being able to follow his lead was 
so embarrassing and frustrating.</i>

10:11.200 --> 10:14.010
<i>I practiced so much that 
my feet nearly wore away.</i>

10:17.210 --> 10:19.950
<i>To think I'd make use of it today...</i>

10:21.400 --> 10:23.720
<i>But more importantly, how is Lady Child?</i>

10:27.540 --> 10:29.400
<i>She's so far away, I can't tell!</i>

10:36.230 --> 10:38.140
Your Highness?

10:40.070 --> 10:43.320
<i>Could he be leading me toward Lady Child?</i>

10:56.540 --> 10:57.600
Lady Child?

10:59.710 --> 11:02.710
You mustn't push yourself so 
hard when you have a fever!

11:02.710 --> 11:05.500
Wouldn't it be better to return 
home and rest for today?

11:05.500 --> 11:11.080
No. Being absent from the birthday 
celebrations would damage my family's honor.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.470
Lady Child!

11:13.440 --> 11:15.060
Then, come with me.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.440
Y-Your Highness!

11:23.260 --> 11:25.040
Shall we, Lady Child?

11:25.520 --> 11:27.080
Yes.

11:31.790 --> 11:34.410
Your Highness, what is this place?

11:35.230 --> 11:38.020
A lounge for the imperial 
family to take respite in.

11:38.020 --> 11:40.170
Rest here for a while.

11:41.240 --> 11:44.180
I-I couldn't possibly impose like this!

11:44.790 --> 11:48.150
If attending the birthday 
celebrations are a noble's duty,

11:48.150 --> 11:51.000
then it is the imperial 
family's duty to help them.

11:51.540 --> 11:54.460
Rest until the emperor's 
celebratory address.

11:55.770 --> 11:57.240
Your Highness...

12:03.460 --> 12:05.360
As you wish.

12:09.060 --> 12:13.510
<i>Lady Child, your lovelorn 
heart is entirely too noble.</i>

12:17.570 --> 12:19.970
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

12:20.500 --> 12:25.580
If you would allow it, I would 
like to stay here as well.

12:25.580 --> 12:26.570
That will be fine.

12:27.360 --> 12:29.170
Thank you.

12:29.170 --> 12:31.920
I'd like to stay with Lady 
Child and look after her.

12:32.590 --> 12:36.230
You're like that with everyone, aren't you?

12:37.060 --> 12:38.080
What?

12:39.890 --> 12:44.820
If anyone else from the Romanoff family 
should come here, use my name.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.060
Yes, Your Highness.

12:59.260 --> 13:02.700
That's good. She's breathing 
more evenly, too.

13:05.260 --> 13:10.640
Ladies, it's nearly time for His 
Majesty's celebratory address.

13:11.570 --> 13:13.590
<i>I've seen her somewhere before.</i>

13:15.860 --> 13:19.500
<i>She's from a great noble house in the west
 blood-related to the imperial family.</i>

13:19.820 --> 13:21.810
Duchess Harbour.

13:22.750 --> 13:26.360
I am Elise of the House of Clorence.

13:26.360 --> 13:28.820
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

13:29.820 --> 13:33.670
Oh, so you're a young lady 
from the Clorence family?

13:33.670 --> 13:36.580
My, are you looking after your friend?

13:36.580 --> 13:37.970
<i>Friend?</i>

13:39.300 --> 13:40.370
Yes!

13:40.370 --> 13:41.760
I see.

13:41.760 --> 13:45.520
If she's feeling well enough, 
you should hurry to the hall.

14:02.810 --> 14:05.630
Lately, my legs have been doing poorly.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.920
Farewell.

14:09.540 --> 14:11.150
<i>The way she's walking...</i>

14:11.650 --> 14:14.480
<i>It's very possible... that she 
has Parkinson's disease.</i>

14:15.730 --> 14:19.560
<i>Parkinson's disease is a 
degeneration of the nerve cells.</i>

14:19.560 --> 14:22.460
<i>The condition causes a decrease in 
motor function throughout the body.</i>

14:23.670 --> 14:25.700
<i>As I recall,</i>

14:25.700 --> 14:28.220
<i>because of this disease, the duchess...</i>

14:28.220 --> 14:31.580
<i>loses her life when food becomes 
lodged in her respiratory tract.</i>

14:38.800 --> 14:40.050
Lady Clorence?

14:50.400 --> 14:53.550
It's wonderful that we'll make it back in 
time for the emperor's address, isn't it?

14:54.000 --> 14:57.570
It must be because you 
have good daily habits.

14:57.950 --> 15:00.090
And you, Lady Clorence.

15:00.090 --> 15:03.580
Thank you... for today.

15:03.580 --> 15:04.900
Not at all.

15:04.900 --> 15:08.780
All I did was do what I could, Lady Child.

15:09.390 --> 15:12.100
Please, call me Juliane.

15:12.100 --> 15:12.910
What?

15:13.450 --> 15:17.860
Then, please call me Elise!

15:20.820 --> 15:26.660
Sometime soon, please allow 
me to accompany you for tea.

15:29.730 --> 15:32.360
Yes, I'd love that, Juliane!

16:00.450 --> 16:06.910
Spending today of all days together 
with you brings me great joy.

16:07.480 --> 16:14.210
I believe that it will allow me to 
discover new hope for the future.

16:15.120 --> 16:21.200
And I pray for this country's peace 
and the happiness of its people.

16:24.920 --> 16:30.180
Now, there is something I would 
like to tell all of you.

16:30.620 --> 16:35.840
It concerns the fiancée of the 
crown prince, Linden de Romanoff.

16:36.300 --> 16:42.060
But there is one thing we did not take 
into account for this announcement.

16:42.280 --> 16:50.680
That the lady which I have decided 
upon for his fiancée is not yet of age.

16:51.300 --> 16:52.800
<i>Announcement?</i>

16:52.800 --> 16:54.510
<i>But that can't be!</i>

16:55.430 --> 17:00.500
Of course, becoming affianced before one 
comes of age poses no breach of etiquette.

17:00.500 --> 17:04.590
However, I have made a personal 
promise to the lady in question,

17:04.590 --> 17:08.460
so the announcement will be delayed 
until after she has come of age.

17:10.610 --> 17:14.410
And so, the official announcement 
of their engagement...

17:15.400 --> 17:20.710
will wait until after Lady 
Clorence has come of age.

17:22.210 --> 17:24.300
So it is Lady Elise!

17:24.300 --> 17:25.940
They're a perfect match!

17:26.920 --> 17:29.170
<i>What's going on?</i>

17:29.730 --> 17:32.240
<i>Why would he say my name?</i>

17:32.660 --> 17:37.800
<i>This is exactly the same as if I'd been 
announced as the prince's fiancée!</i>

17:41.240 --> 17:46.250
Now, let us continue the festivities. 
Please, enjoy yourselves.

18:03.170 --> 18:04.350
Whoa, there.

18:05.470 --> 18:07.410
Prince Mikhail.

18:10.300 --> 18:12.860
It's a secret that I'm here.

18:13.510 --> 18:15.130
Y-Yes, Your Highness.

18:23.480 --> 18:27.790
So that's the girl who will become 
my big brother's fiancée, is it?

18:34.510 --> 18:36.760
Atone for your crimes in hell.

18:49.760 --> 18:52.410
Please call Elise in to see me.

18:52.950 --> 18:53.910
Yes, sire.

18:53.910 --> 18:59.850
The ordeal that you proposed for her 
must surely have her bewildered.

18:59.850 --> 19:02.650
And I'm sure she must have questions for me.

19:02.650 --> 19:04.350
As you command, sire.

19:09.900 --> 19:12.620
Lady, is the tea not to your liking?

19:15.590 --> 19:22.270
Your Majesty, if I might have your permission,
there is something I would like to ask you.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.370
Go ahead and speak.

19:26.420 --> 19:29.600
What happened to the wager we made?

19:30.300 --> 19:31.370
In that case,

19:31.920 --> 19:34.390
let's make a wager.

19:34.390 --> 19:37.230
Make a wager?

19:37.600 --> 19:40.570
Pass the exams and become a doctor.

19:40.810 --> 19:45.380
Prove that your work as a doctor is more 
valuable than your existence as an empress.

19:47.440 --> 19:51.790
If you can prove that, then you 
may take whatever path you wish.

19:51.790 --> 19:55.450
But if you are unable to prove that,

19:56.030 --> 20:01.910
then you will turn all your thoughts and 
energy toward becoming our future empress.

20:03.860 --> 20:07.190
<i>The wager was meant to last until I came of age.</i>

20:07.190 --> 20:08.850
<i>I should have still had time.</i>

20:09.510 --> 20:12.470
<i>Does His Majesty intend 
to nullify the wager?</i>

20:16.840 --> 20:19.980
The wager is, of course, still in effect.

20:20.280 --> 20:21.270
What?

20:21.640 --> 20:25.280
I would not break a promise 
that I have made.

20:25.280 --> 20:28.800
And I haven't made a formal announcement,

20:28.800 --> 20:33.450
so should you happen to win the wager, it is 
entirely possible to withdraw what was said.

20:34.440 --> 20:37.180
But will it really be all right?

20:37.810 --> 20:43.060
If Your Majesty retracts his words so easily,
won't it cause injury to your magnificence?

20:43.290 --> 20:47.540
His Majesty's dignity would not be 
harmed by a trifle such as this.

20:47.540 --> 20:50.700
Yes, you're correct.

20:51.300 --> 20:55.500
Lady Elise, it seems you're worried 
about what might happen when you win.

20:55.500 --> 20:58.380
Do you have a specific plan in mind?

20:58.380 --> 20:59.350
What?

20:59.960 --> 21:04.550
Your work as a doctor has more value 
than your existence as empress...

21:04.550 --> 21:08.820
What achievements do you intend to 
accomplish to prove such a thing?

21:09.130 --> 21:10.450
<i>Achievements?</i>

21:11.380 --> 21:16.440
<i>That means that I won't be acknowledged 
for just any little thing.</i>

21:16.960 --> 21:21.770
I've come to think of you as 
though you were my own daughter.

21:21.770 --> 21:27.440
I find your determination 
endearing, but at the same time,

21:27.440 --> 21:32.740
I want you to support Linden and 
become my daughter in truth.

21:33.370 --> 21:38.000
These feelings are part of why 
I made that announcement.

21:38.000 --> 21:39.230
Your Majesty...

21:39.880 --> 21:42.170
<i>Why does he feel so much for me?</i>

21:42.170 --> 21:44.220
<i>Is it because I'm his 
dear friend's daughter?</i>

21:45.340 --> 21:48.160
<i>Or could it be because of 
the way I acted that day?</i>

21:51.240 --> 21:52.980
What do you think?

21:54.600 --> 22:00.000
I'd like to put an end to our 
wager here. What about you?

22:06.260 --> 22:10.010
Daylight Fantasies,
Nighttime Dreams
